OL,3,GNEWSAScout, 13, among youngest to
OL,4,Acollect all 95 badges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 13-year-old Scout has become one of
OL,7,Fthe youngest ever to collect all 95
OL,8,Fbadges.
OL,10,FSienna, who achieved the feat within
OL,11,Ftwo years of joining the 4th Ripon
OL,12,FScout Troop, said she had "enjoyed it
OL,13,Fso much".
OL,15,FThe haul includes 63 activity badges,
OL,16,F15 Staged badges, nine Challenge
OL,17,Fawards, four You Shape awards, the
OL,18,FEarth Tribe award, Assistant Patrol
OL,19,FLeader badge and her two-year joining
OL,20,Fin award.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
